 <h3><u>Qambar aur fizza</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Suno suno suno suno.(4)</p> 
  <p>hai dosto ye chashme tasawwur ka waqea<br> ek din hua jo qambar o fizza ka saamna<br> dono ko ehle bait ki nisbat pe naaz tha<br> phir ye hua ke chhid gaya rutbo ka tazkera<br> is ghar ke naukro ke hai kya aabru suno<br> us dam hui thi dono me jo guftugu suno</p> 
  <p>suno suno, qambar aur fizza ki guftugu suno</p> 
  <p>1. Qambar ye bola sabse hai rutba mera juda<br> mashhoor do jaha me hu mai abd e mustafa<br> maula ne yu kiya meri qismat ka faisla<br> shayan e shaan martaba mujhko ataa hua<br> sad shukr mai ghulam e janabe ameer hu<br> shaho ko bheek deta hu aisa faqeer hu</p> 
  <p>2. Fizza ne di sada mere pucho na martabe<br> tey karti hu mai lamho me sadyo ke faasle<br> mashhoor do jahaan me hai mere waqea<br> hote hai arsh walo me bhi mere tazkere<br> bus ye sifat hi kaafi hai kaunain ke liye<br> mai rotiya pakati hu hasnain k liye</p> 
  <p>3. Qambar ye bola aaj suno mere mojizat<br> bus mai hi jaanta hu ghulami ki kul sifat<br> jis dam ali ke qadmo pe hote hai mere haath<br> mehsus mujhko hoti hai mutthi me kayenaat<br> thokar se meri noor ke chashme ubharte hai<br> shams o qamar bhi mere ishare pe chalte hai</p> 
  <p>4. Fizza ne daad deke kaha meri baat sun<br> kaisi hasi mili hai mujhe kayenaat sun<br> wo tere mojize the mere mojizaat sun<br> pohche hai kis maqam pe fizza ke haath sun<br> maine hasan husain ko inse uthaya hai<br> zainab ko mere haatho ne chalna sikhaya hai</p> 
  <p>5. Qambar ye bola sach hai mai koi nabi nahi<br> mere liye to koi shariyat bani nahi<br> mujhko koi kitaab khuda se mili nahi<br> par mere ikhteyaar me bhi kuch kami nahi<br> haider ki naukri ke sabab kaamyaab hu<br> mai chalti phirti ishq e ali ki kitaab hu</p> 
  <p>6. Fizza ye boli dekha hai ismat ka maine noor<br> khair un nisa ke faiz se hasil hai ye ghuroor<br> maryam se badhke bakhsha gaya hai mujhe sha'oor<br> mujhse rakha hai fatima zehra ne rijs door<br> khilqat se khaake khidmate binte rasool hu<br> sadqa hai ye batool ka mai bhi batool hu</p> 
  <p>7. Qambar ye bola maanne wala hu asl ka<br> qael hu dil se mai bhi bila fasl wasl ka<br> seekha hai ba ke nuqte se har nuqta aql ka<br> mujhko mila hai dars imamat se adl ka<br> saani nahi hai koi mera khaas o aam me<br> maula ne mera haath bataya hai kaam me</p> 
  <p>8. Fizza ye boli haan ye ali ka usool hai<br> yeh bhi to soch meri muddaris batool hai<br> jiske sabab shariyaton ka arz o tool hai<br> ehsaan kisi ka fatima ko kab qabool hai<br> binte nabi say main ne masawaat seekhi hay<br> Khud fatima ne chakki mere saath pisi hay<br> <br> 9. Akbar qalam ko rok le mushkil hai faisla<br> is dar ki naukri ka sharaf hai bohot bada<br> kitni fazeelaton ka hai manzar yeh martaba<br> yeh khadim e Ali hai woh zehra ki khadima<br> dono ki baat apni jaga lajawab hai<br> in ki koi misaal na un ka jawab hai</p> 
